<title>SINGAPORE: CarnauldMetalbox full year loss deepens.</title>
<headline>CarnauldMetalbox full year loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			  15.88     vs	11.94</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 5.00     vs	10.00</p>
<p>    Group share loss (cents)   (21.60)    vs     (16.20)</p>
<p>    Turnover			 234.89     vs     235.65</p>
<p>    Operating profit		15.76     vs	13.56</p>
<p>    Interest expense		 9.74     vs	 9.09</p>
<p>    Depreciation, amortisation  27.12     vs	21.15</p>
<p>    Tax				  1.22     vs	 1.11</p>
<p>    Minorities			 7.04     vs	 5.60</p>
<p>    Associates			(0.62)    vs	 0.25</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     (137.25)*    vs	 nil</p>
<p>Dividend register/pay :  July 7/July 18</p>
<p>* The extraordinary items include asset write-offs of investments in China and also closure costs in Singapore. Note - Packaging company CarnaudMetalbox Asia Ltd is part of CarnaudMetalbox.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
